we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot q & ={p}_{1}\\cdot {q}_{1}+{p}_{2}\\cdot {q}_{2}+{p}_{3}\\cdot {q}_{3}+{p}_{4}\\cdot {q}_{4}+{p}_{5}\\cdot {q}_{5} \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot 2+4\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-3)+(-2)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-10-4-4-9-10 \\\\  & =-37\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120372 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119804 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "94f8e0e5-8d8a-516a-8f46-d76e94305df4" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Value of an Unknown Quantity in an Expression Involving the Dot Product"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13a4ee8b-559e-5e77-9422-085f02cafe83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411202} {:answer/id #uuid "854cec98-1727-5fc7-bb93-ee8180ba2e49" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411229} {:answer/id #uuid "d298adbc-2459-5205-b26e-bae5030bd794" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411243} {:answer/id #uuid "f2d3286d-460d-594b-a654-7960991941b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411251} {:answer/id #uuid "fed82051-c308-5ab8-a57d-71d1e9f17b02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411253}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d298adbc-2459-5205-b26e-bae5030bd794" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411243} :answer-field/id #uuid "146d2282-b3c3-51c4-a040-01b6b777627e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411256}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5c9313c3-2433-57d0-996e-22d653a6cec8" :question/math-academy-id "q-35129" :question/problem "Let\n$a=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}p \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].$\nIf $a\\cdot b=8$, find the value of $p.$" :question/worked-solution "Starting from the equation $a\\cdot b=8,$ we compute the dot product in terms of $p$ and then solve for $p$ in the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =8 \\\\ 5\\cdot p+0\\cdot (-3)+p\\cdot 7+1\\cdot (-4) & =8 \\\\ 5p+7p-4 & =8 \\\\ 12p & =12 \\\\ p & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $p=1.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120374 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119802 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab0d2c2f-e7a4-51bb-a20a-f28c2f7ded8b" :knowledge-point/title "Adding Multiples of Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "311efe6b-f496-5670-9f7d-30ac84de1073" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 16 \\\\ 35 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411210} {:answer/id #uuid "55eeea6a-8ddf-51ac-9617-dba1b612dba3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411218} {:answer/id #uuid "bb2f291a-55c3-59b4-b919-08596a4512cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}34 \\\\ 41 \\\\ -46 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411238} {:answer/id #uuid "cb40e0c2-643a-5d5c-a483-f11a10eeef9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 16 \\\\ 35\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411241} {:answer/id #uuid "dbdc5f37-738b-5659-95df-24f57bf912fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/iden