ld/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411261}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8fbe6a49-60d8-5901-b7da-6252cc956f06" :question/math-academy-id "q-73932" :question/problem "Let $p=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $q=[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}].$ Find $\\frac{1}{2}p-\\frac{1}{3}q.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we multiply each component of $p$ by $\\frac{1}{2}$ and each component of $q$ by $\\frac{1}{3}.$ Then, we substract the vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}p-\\frac{1}{3}q & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0-(-3) \\\\ 4-1 \\\\ -3-0 \\\\ 1-2 \\\\ 1-(-2)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186411271 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119802 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab0d2c2f-e7a4-51bb-a20a-f28c2f7ded8b" :knowledge-point/title "Adding Multiples of Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0eaa34a7-a085-545f-91fe-beae8d47c684" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 11 \\\\ 12 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411200} {:answer/id #uuid "1c62dcda-8b75-5d10-8e57-034327e30a34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{12}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{27}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{6}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411206